# Generated DSM/XDSM visualisations -- regenerate with `render_xdsm.py` / `sand.py`.
functional_process/*.html
# ...except the four the Pages workflow publishes. `.github/workflows/pages.yml` copies
# these out of a bare `actions/checkout` and has no build step ("Copying five committed
# files cannot fail"), so an untracked one is a broken deploy, not a missing nicety.
# c3b82552 added the rule above and deleted these four in the same commit -- collateral
# to a Warp change -- and every push to `main` has failed at `cp` since 2026-09-06.
!functional_process/dsm_provenance_uncut.html
!functional_process/dsm_scc_uncut.html
!functional_process/dsm_provenance_uncut_tokamak.html
!functional_process/dsm_scc_uncut_tokamak.html

# Generated Warp source -- regenerate with `functional_process/cottax/warp/`.
functional_process/warp/
